config DEMO_MISSING_PAGE
    bool "Hide weather page in demo fixture"
    default n
    help
        Remove the weather page from the deterministic demo registry.

config BATTERY_CALIBRATION_PERMILLE
    int "Battery divider calibration (permille of the nominal 3x divider)"
    default 1000
    help
        Real dividers run a few percent off nominal. To calibrate: read the
        reported battery millivolts, measure the actual cell voltage with a
        multimeter across the battery terminals, then set this to
        1000 * multimeter_mV / reported_mV. 1000 applies no trim.
